Z||000000||Formula||07-14-2000||03:24 PM||||I'm getting my car painted next week.....<P>I would like to hear what creative color schemes people would do to a formula...<P>btw...all the moldings and the mirrors and the black thing on the bottom will be body color, like a new car, and I am going to get some type of vinyl put back on it!!<P>Right now its bright red with a grey stripe, but I was thinking about switching to dark red with a pair of Viper Style white stripes and maybe have Corvette Grand Sport slashes on one of the fenders, I want to get Formula written extremly aggresively on the side and all other badges, except the front will be shaved........ I was also thinking of having the same scheme as now except use canary yellow paint with a black stripe, and have Formula wriiten down the side of the car like a rice or I mean race car........next I'm thinking about Black with 2 white Cobra stripes (smaller), and getting formula written on the sides bigger and slanted......... I could always  get the regular red put back on and redo the same stripe but that would be boring.......I really want your opinions and a lot more suggestions!!!!!........Any thing that you ever thought would look cool on a fiero, tell me and I might get it, if I like the idea, I basically want to stay with an easy to find color, the vinyl that I can get is black, red, blue, silver, yellow, white, green and a couple other colors,  <P>And the person who thinks of the coolest scheme before next week can name it and the name (if not bad language) will be written on the dashboard with white vinyl!!!<P>heres before, and after will be on in a week or 2!!<P>BEFORE<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stripes1formula.JPG">  <P>||||reg||1
Z||000001||fropuff||07-14-2000||03:33 PM||||I always liked the Gran Sport (I think it's GRAN...?)blue on the Corvette.  I think it would look the best on a Fiero.  Then, put the Gran Sport white racing stripe down the center of the hood, on the roof panels, and continuing down to the rear deck lid and dropping down to the rear fascia.  Finally, put the triple (?) red slashes on the left fender like the 'Vette.  I think it would look awesome!  Then you have the black wheels like the Gran Sport as well.  I think you should give it a try.  <P>P.S: Are you keeping the Fiero emblem on the front fascia.  I know it's about the only exterior marking, but it would look kind of weird with the white racing stripe.  Sorry to say.||||reg||1
