Z||000004||fropuff||07-14-2000||03:52 PM||||Or, instead of using the Gran Sport racing stripe, you could use the double racing stripes like the Viper GTS.  ||||reg||1
Z||000005||Formula||07-14-2000||03:56 PM||||yeah, you definetly have me thinking about blue now........ its just a cool color||||reg||1
Z||000006||fropuff||07-14-2000||04:12 PM||||Okay, I got one more idea then I'll shut up.  Paint it all white.  Then, paint an orange racing stripe smack down the center.  It'll be the same scheme like a 30th anniversary Chevrolet Camaro.<P>P.S:  I really like blue, too.||||reg||1
Z||000007||Formula||07-14-2000||04:18 PM||||that would look ok.........I want ideas so I can think about this and make a good choice...so keep em coming,  but I dont want to go with white for cleaning reasons, I live in the country and it only stays clean for a day at a time.....but so far I think the gran sport paint job is winning!!||||reg||1
