Z||000030||ur2biteme||07-15-2000||08:31 AM||||Now I'm not an old fart and i'm not into the graphics and such.  Original looking stuff on the formula looks cool. I think an offset single wide stripe the leingth of the car, similar to the one allready on there, or a double wide stripe would look cool.  If I had to go with graphics, i'd go with a medium gray Formula decal to replace the originals, a pearl black paint scheme, and if you wanted the stripes, i'd do the wide dual stripes.  <P>my thing about graphics is that the cars i see all too often with these graphics are these friggin rice rockets.  I don't see the Fiero fitting into that category.  leave that to the toyota Fie..., i mean MR2.||||reg||1
