Z||000039||fropuff||07-18-2000||11:55 PM||||Maybe "Formula's GS" or "Formula GS".  Might be a good name for it.  Any critiques from anyone?  I don't really know.  I'm not the most clever or original person in the world.  I'm sure it will look really good when done.  I'm getting mine painted next week; Thursday I think.  I'm bringing it over to the guy on Tuesday for him to feather-fill some deep chips.  Then we'll mask on Wednesday night to get it ready to paint on Thursday.  I'm getting a little impatient.  I've been waiting since Easter for it to be done.  I won't be able to wait any longer.  I think it will turn out pretty nice.  Again, I was thinking of "Formula GS" (not G.S.)  The GS doesn't have to mean "Gran Sport".  You can come up with the acrostic words for "GS" yourself.  I had a pretty hard time coming up with "Formula GS".  If anyone has a problem with "Formula GS", let me know.  That's the best I can do right now.||||reg||10
